{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065817/block/singleImage/3278559/df/01M8AXSZ92FG0QJBB6WRMB1T6C.jpg?updatedAt=1795666296\"/><figcaption>屯門龍門路貨車輕鐵相撞，輕鐵服務一度受阻3條路綫改道。(屯門友@threads)</figcaption></figure><p>今日(26日)早上約10時半，一輛正前往屯門碼頭站的輕鐵不載客列車，在駛至湖翠路與龍門路交界，按照燈號指示左轉時，被一架中型貨車撞到。受事故影響，輕鐵610綫、615綫及615P綫需要改道，不停屯門碼頭站至輕鐵車廠站。 港鐵即時安排免費接駁巴士來往屯門碼頭及三聖站，以及來往蝴蝶及兆禧站。事件於約11時處理好，輕鐵服務逐步回復正常。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:40:51.244075+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:06:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T22:29:04.646710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:34:01.353535+00:00","content_hash":"0f73570804d49d7badfc82a8a58cee166004f979ea56c19bcb872ee99d09339e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:40:51.244075+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}